    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/e/e7/PleiaQBULB.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240803002302\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"PleiaQBULB\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/e/e7/PleiaQBULB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240803002302\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"726\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"PleiaQBULB.jpg\" data-image-key=\"PleiaQBULB.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>战斗商人</b>\n</p><p><br />\n\n一个商人家庭的女儿。她厌恶折扣。\n这就是为什么她无法服务顾客、进行谈判或离开父母家。\n她知道她帮不上家里的生意，但一直在努力。在这个过程中，她已经成为一名出色的战士。\n\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821131854\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39530-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260821131854 and revision id 63607. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
